return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'将此 WordPress 网站连接至 Zinn Digital®，以便将计划发布的文章发布到该网站。从您的 Zinn® 仪表板粘贴配对码，插件即可自行设置凭据——无需手动复制。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'此网站的 PHP 无法创建归档，因此无法进行备份。','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'无法创建临时文件。','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'无法将此网站的文件存档。','The archive could not be read back.'=>'无法读取该存档。','The backup could not be uploaded.'=>'备份无法上传。','The backup upload was rejected.'=>'备份上传被拒绝。','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'此 WordPress 用户无法发布文章，因此现在建立的连接也无法发布文章。请以具有发布权限的用户身份登录，然后重试。','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'本网站已禁用应用程序密码，因此我们无法创建凭据。请联系您的主机提供商启用该功能，或使用您自己在 Zinn Digital® 控制面板中创建的密码连接网站。','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress 无法为此网站创建凭据。没有任何内容被发送到任何地方。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'无法从该网站连接到 Zinn Digital®。未连接任何内容，且我们创建的凭据已被删除。请检查该网站是否可以发送出站请求，然后重试。','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® 未接受该配对码。未连接任何内容。请在您的控制面板中生成新代码并重试。','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'已连接。Zinn Digital® 现在可以发布到此网站。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读%s用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的人群打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟的网站、域名和外链，资金安全托管，直到双方满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作家、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','This site is connected to Zinn Digital®, publishing as %s.'=>'此网站已连接到 Zinn Digital®，发布方为 %s。','To disconnect, revoke the “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password on %s.'=>'若要断开连接，请在 %s 上撤销“Zinn Digital® (publishing)”应用程序密码。','your profile'=>'您的个人资料','Connect this site'=>'连接此站点','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'打开您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表板，前往“内容”→“其他站点”，然后点击“获取配对码”。将其粘贴到下方。','Pairing code'=>'配对码','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'它会在您生成后的三十分钟内过期，且只能使用一次。','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'您无权连接此网站。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'请参阅 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，因此未进行安装。']];